This is my 1st Healer ascension.   I tried on several occasions,
YASDed often with a cockatrice accident.  I almost didn't finish this
game.
I had to dive down Gehennom 3 or 4 times to regain the true amulet.
In the Sanctum, I thought I had it, but I did not check until the
Castle!!!
I thought it was weird that I did not encounter the mysterious
force!!
The Rodney double troubled me several times and kept stealing the
amulet
and my staff of Aesculapius.

The Astral plane was a cinch, first altar was the correct one.
I had a pet Archon to help.  Death went down in 2 whacks of Vorpy
and he never bothered me again.

Message to the Dev team, Gehennom may add a slight increase in
difficulty,
but it is too tedious.   My preference would be to change the
labyrinths
to some of the pre-castle levels including special levels like the big
room.
I could also do without the mysterious force.  That's it.  thanks for
your time.

New strategies for me were:
1) tinning kits and giant corpses to get my strength high.
2) get rid of those pesky semi colons
3) Alternate between Vorpal and Aesculapius

